# L §8.3 LOAD-KEY: "<key> is not a key of <index or kind>" (a key literal resolved by its position, L §2.5).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "a source"

index ks = [a, b]
input x[k in ks]: int

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  x[c] = 1
=== expect
refused: LOAD-KEY ...
